+# Tool Input Validation
+
+| Field  | Value |
+| ------ | ----- |
+| Issue  | #37   |
+| Status | Draft |
+
+`ToolRegistry.execute` validates an input against the resolved tool definition's `inputSchema` before invoking its executor; rejected input returns a `ToolResponse` describing the validation failure and does not invoke the executor ([validated by: rejects a missing required tool input before executor invocation](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L5)).
